Security Group → Firewall

Key Pair → SSH authentication

Elastic IP → Static public IP

ENI → Virtual network card

Load Balancer → Distributes traffic

Target Group → Servers behind Load Balancer

Auto Scaling → Automatically adds/removes servers

Spot Instance → Discounted, interruptible EC2

Reserved Instance → Long-term EC2 pricing commitment

Capacity Reservation → Reserve EC2 capacity

